TGPulse-Next Libretro is an independent port of TGPulse-Next, based on TGPulse.
The initial source snapshot is TGPulse-Next commit
3c75f9b2b155e8bb50a225c69520948ef72ecd48.

Project source is distributed under the root MIT license. Original copyright
and license notices remain applicable. Dependency license declarations,
versions, authors and license texts are supplied under licenses/ in binary
packages. The imported MAME and YMFM BSD notices and the Libretro API notice
are included separately in that directory.

SM2-Emu Libretro and Supermodel Libretro are workflow/architecture references,
not runtime dependencies. No game ROMs or user save data are distributed.
